<title>USA: TABLE - Schuff Steel Q2 pro forma net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Schuff Steel Q2 pro forma net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended    Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				    June 30,		  June 30,</p>
<p>				    1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
